{{Upcoming}}
The '''Guardian Slayer''' is an upcoming [[Slayer]] that will involve slaying [[Sea Creatures]] unique to the [[Desecrated Shrine]], which is accessible via [[Ship Navigator]] once a currently unknown NPC is recruited into the player's [[Ship Crew]]. The name of the slayer's boss or minibosses are currently unknown.

== Abilities ==
The '''Guardian Slayer''' was said to have its abilities directly linked to the '''Desecrated Shrine'''<nowiki/>'s map.
